   "lines": [
    "Broke camp and went",
    "about six miles farther,",
    "to a branch of the",
    "Ten Sleep; better camp.",
    "Snowed last night;",
    "all this afternoon",
    "it snowed at inter-",
    "vals, so that the",
    "country has quite a",
    "wintry look; in the",
    "moonlight at night",
    "the scenery is very",
    "beautiful.",
    "The bear meat",
    "is very good eating; I",
    "have never been in",
    "better health. California",
    "is a superb riding",
    "horse; he is not so",
    "good as[?] a hunting",
    "pony as Blackie or",
    "Spleitear[?]."
   ],
